--TEST--
`Type::` written inside another call's arguments, with the editor's closing parenthesis after the cursor, offers that type's static half and not the enclosing call's argument list — `rule:ide/the-index-answers-the-cursor`
--FILE--
<?nvs
use Core\Request;
use Core\Debug;
Debug::dump(Request::<|>)
--REQUEST--
completion limit=3
--EXPECT--
body()  method    tainted string
bodyStream() method    Core\Request\BodyStream
bytes() method    tainted bytes
